{"4157090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SLAMAVERSE!", "steam_appid": 4157090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR WRESTLER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of our 8 International Wrestling Syndicate wrestlers have a different playstyle and each have access to unique abilities that can change the course of a match. Are you more of a direct damage powerhouse or are you a submission specialist looking to deck-out your opponent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157090/extras/e09b5286f9369506594e1e1805e553a5.avif?t=1787660079\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience in matches to unlock booster packs with new cards to grow your collection and build a championship winning 60 card deck. With over 200 cards to chose from, you can play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157090/extras/e5afedae4e6a1ac427c6ca3052e1f2c7.avif?t=1787660079\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASH IN THE RING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends or play against other player's decks using our Booking tool. Play single matches or put your deck to the test in our endless mode: The Gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157090/extras/3ffbc055702913d87a8697fd1cf61702.avif?t=1787660079\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR WRESTLER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of our 8 International Wrestling Syndicate wrestlers have a different playstyle and each have access to unique abilities that can change the course of a match. Are you more of a direct damage powerhouse or are you a submission specialist looking to deck-out your opponent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157090/extras/e09b5286f9369506594e1e1805e553a5.avif?t=1787660079\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience in matches to unlock booster packs with new cards to grow your collection and build a championship winning 60 card deck. With over 200 cards to chose from, you can play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157090/extras/e5afedae4e6a1ac427c6ca3052e1f2c7.avif?t=1787660079\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASH IN THE RING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends or play against other player's decks using our Booking tool. Play single matches or put your deck to the test in our endless mode: The Gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157090/extras/3ffbc055702913d87a8697fd1cf61702.avif?t=1787660079\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to the SLAMAVERSE!, a world where everything is wrestling and wrestling is everything! Choose your wrestler, build a deck, and battle against friends and foes in this hard-hitting, tactical deckbuilder. Do you have what it takes to become the champ?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</str